  {
    "id": "skyreach_provisioner",
    "name": "Skyreach Provisioner",
    "$comment": "The most expensive counter in Caelora to stock and the cheapest to explain: nothing on these shelves grew, was mined or was made within a day of here, so everything carries either a road or a cable. What it leans on is the two things a city on cliffs actually consumes -- healing, because people fall, and revives, because the Hall above it is the seventh one. The Warden Vessel is NOT on this list and cannot be: it has no price in data/items/items.json, and tests/state.test.js is right to fail a shop that sells one. It is a floor pickup, twice on this map and three times in the Hall, which is a better way to hand out five of them anyway.",
    "greeting": [
      "Everything here came up the road or across the gorge. The price is which."
